# The core demo is offline and requires no environment variables.
# Development-only data acquisition scripts use fixed public source URLs.

# Optional: enables the "Ask HeatHunter" chat and floor-plan reading.
# Copy this file to .env (git-ignored) and paste your key from
# https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys. A real environment variable wins.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# HEATHUNTER_ASSISTANT_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
